1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:03,220
(Amy:)What's the problem?

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,690
(Bernadette:)They're just asking me

3
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:06,530
(Bernadette:)all sorts of questions
I can't answer.

4
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:08,530
(Amy:)Just change the subject.

5
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:10,530
(Bernadette:)I suppose I could get them back
to talking about Leonard

6
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,270
(Bernadette:)going to India
to meet Priya's parents.

7
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:13,720
What?!

8
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,320
(Bernadette:)They said something about
going there this summer.

9
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,410
(Penny:)What, are they getting engaged?

10
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:21,340
(Bernadette:)I don't know. I was too busy
covering my heinie

11
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:23,840
(Bernadette:)on Amy's stupid
astronaut story!

12
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:26,180
(Amy:)What astronaut story?

13
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:28,750
(Bernadette:)You texted me Penny's
dating an astronaut.

14
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:30,720
I texted "architect."
That's amusing.

15
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:33,590
(Amy:)Auto-correct
must've changed it.

16
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:37,320
(Bernadette:)Yeah, it's hysterical.

17
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:39,930
(Penny:)All right, look, just forget
about the astronaut.

18
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:42,960
(Amy:)Architect. Where would you
have met an astronaut?

19
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,000
(Penny:)Look, just find out what's up
with this trip to India.

20
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,870
(Bernadette:)I don't want
to do this anymore!

21
00:00:48,870 --> 00:00:49,900
(Penny:)Don't you quit on us!

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,410
(Howard(knocking on bathroom door):)Bernie, you okay?

23
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:55,180
(Bernadette(screaming):)It was an architect!

24
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,400
(Raj:)Thank you for coming
with me, Sheldon.

25
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,450
(Raj:)You're a good friend.

